    GC_Briefing "{F583BA9BDE1CED94}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "a. Enemy Forces:"\
     "A Russian motorrifle company has landed south of our position at the port of ST PIERRE. A detatched platoon consisting of infantry and BTR-70s is moving to secure the northern end of GREEN VALLEY."\
     ""\
     "b. Friendly Forces:"\
     "2 Platoon A Company is deployed at VERNON in order to delay enemy movement into the valley. 2'1 (us) is currently at the initial fallback position located at the farmstead and bridge crossing. We have an attached MG team, FiST (Forward Observer), and 1x Mortar team deployed at DURRAS."\
     ""\
     "c. Terrain:"\
     "GREEN VALLEY is a long narrow valley with steap sides and dense forests. There is one road out of the valley."\
     ""\
     "d. Civilian:"\
     "Civilians have mostly evacuated the area but there are still some evacuating. Beware of road vehicles and civillians fleeing on foot."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{60C37B1317313CD8}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "a. Enemy Forces:"\
     "A US platoon is currently defending VERNON. They are armed with light AT, Anti-Tank Mines, and are supported by a Mortar Team."\
     ""\
     "b. Friendly Forces:"\
     "We are 1 Platoon with attached BRDM Recon element situated at ST PIERRE. Company is currently deploying from the sea and are unable to support us. Preparatory will be conducted on VERNON at ~1315 LT ahead of your movement."\
     ""\
     "c. Terrain is a narrow valley with steep sides and forests on the slopes. There is one road out of the valley."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
